{"headword":"בְּ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Aramaic Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>prep. in, with, through</strong>, etc. <strong>(</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span><strong>)</strong>;—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">Dn 4:6</a> +, 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">3:7</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:41\" href=\"/Daniel.2.41\">2:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:6\" href=\"/Daniel.3.6\">3:6</a> +, 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">3:25</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>in</em>, of place, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:38\" href=\"/Daniel.2.38\">2:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:1\" href=\"/Daniel.3.1\">3:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּאֱסוּר</span> +; <em>at</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:10\" href=\"/Ezra.5.10\">Ezr 5:10</a>, of time <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">Dn 2:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:5\" href=\"/Daniel.3.5\">3:5</a> (<em>at</em>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">5:2</a> +; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:16\" href=\"/Ezra.4.16\">Ezr 4:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלָק בְּ׳</span> a share <em>in</em> (BH <strong>I. 2</strong>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>into</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:38\" href=\"/Daniel.2.38\">Dn 2:38</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהַב בִּידָךְ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:12\" href=\"/Ezra.5.12\">Ezr 5:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדָה ב׳</span> pass <em>over</em> or <em>upon</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:27\" href=\"/Daniel.3.27\">Dn 3:27</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of the instrument, <em>by, with</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:30\" href=\"/Daniel.2.30\">Dn 2:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:34\" href=\"/Daniel.2.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Dani